{"1066070":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Cave In: Miner Rescue Team","steam_appid":1066070,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"The San Marino Mine is on the verge of collapse, and it is up to the Miner Rescue Team to rescue the trapped miners before it is too late.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 3D match-3 puzzler filled with hazards<\/h2>Push, kick, and shoot your way through dangerous puzzles to get to the trapped miners and escape before the mine collapses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Something new every day<\/h2>Every player gets the same cave in the Daily and Weekly Challenges - finish it fast and climb the Steam leaderboard. Caves are generated fresh, so there is always a new one waiting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race your friends<\/h2>Tournaments put up to 32 players in the same caves over three or five rounds. Every place scores, the final round pays double, and one life is all you get.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and share<\/h2>Make your own caves in the map editor and publish them to the Steam Workshop, or browse and play what other players have built.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story Mode - 80 hand-built levels<br><\/li><li>Survival<br><\/li><li>Battle and Co-op<br><\/li><li>Daily and Weekly Challenges with Steam leaderboards<br><\/li><li>Online Tournaments for up to 32 players<br><\/li><li>Map editor and Steam Workshop<br><\/li><li>Steam Deck ready<\/li><\/ul><br>","about_the_game":"The San Marino Mine is on the verge of collapse, and it is up to the Miner Rescue Team to rescue the trapped miners before it is too late.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 3D match-3 puzzler filled with hazards<\/h2>Push, kick, and shoot your way through dangerous puzzles to get to the trapped miners and escape before the mine collapses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Something new every day<\/h2>Every player gets the same cave in the Daily and Weekly Challenges - finish it fast and climb the Steam leaderboard. Caves are generated fresh, so there is always a new one waiting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race your friends<\/h2>Tournaments put up to 32 players in the same caves over three or five rounds. Every place scores, the final round pays double, and one life is all you get.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and share<\/h2>Make your own caves in the map editor and publish them to the Steam Workshop, or browse and play what other players have built.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story Mode - 80 hand-built levels<br><\/li><li>Survival<br><\/li><li>Battle and Co-op<br><\/li><li>Daily and Weekly Challenges with Steam leaderboards<br><\/li><li>Online Tournaments for up to 32 players<br><\/li><li>Map editor and Steam Workshop<br><\/li><li>Steam Deck ready<\/li><\/ul><br>","short_description":"Cave In: Miner Rescue is a 3D match-3 puzzler. Rescue the miners trapped in a collapsing mine before it caves in. Push, kick or shoot rocks to solve puzzles and escape. 80 hand-built levels, Survival, Multiplayer, Daily and Weekly Challenges, Tournaments and Workshop maps!","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1066070\/52357c27b1f844169a66d727cd57668c01429762\/header.jpg?t=1793748492","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1066070\/d6cf9a3fb2c96d042f9e4e5133290d938361adf5\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793748492","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1066070\/d6cf9a3fb2c96d042f9e4e5133290d938361adf5\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793748492","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.0 capable, 512 MB VRAM (Intel HD 4000 \/ GeForce 8600 \/ Radeon HD 4000 or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any DirectSound-compatible device<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system. Gamepad optional; keyboard and mouse supported.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core 2.5 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3 capable, 1 GB VRAM (GeForce GTX 660 \/ Radeon HD 7770 or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any DirectSound-compatible device<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Xbox or PlayStation controller recommended.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Area Code 313 Games LLC"],"publishers":["Area Code 313 Games LLC"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":999,"final":699,"discount_percent":30,"initial_formatted":"$9.99","final_formatted":"$6.99"},"packages":[356786],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Cave In: Miner Rescue Team","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":356786,"percent_savings_text":"-30% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Cave In: Miner Rescue Team - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$9.99<\/span> $6.99","option_description":"","can_get_fre